        "app_name": "DataMesh One",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "DataMesh One is an application focused on 3D and mixed reality content display and collaboration, providing an immersive spatial experience. It, together with DataMesh Studio (a zero-code 3D+XR content creation tool), forms the DataMesh Director—a powerful process design and training tool that significantly enhances communication and training efficiency.\n\n----- Application Scenarios -----\n\n[Educational Training]\nCombines fast 3D content editing with hands-on demonstrations, effectively used in various educational and vocational training scenarios. Virtual devices replace physical ones, significantly reducing costs.\n\n[After-Sales Support]\nEnhances after-sales service experience through a combination of virtual and real product operation demonstrations, achieving dual optimization of cost and efficiency.\n\n[Maintenance Guidance]\nAccurate 3D models and step-by-step instructions ensure that technicians can perform maintenance on equipment and facilities efficiently and accurately.\n\n[Marketing Display]\nLarge-scale mixed reality (MR) experience provides a comprehensive 3D display of product variations, suitable for various large exhibition scenarios.\n\n[Remote Collaboration]\nMulti-device MR remote collaboration and design with synchronized 3D content, reducing ineffective communication.\n\n----- Contact Us -----\n\nDataMesh Official Website: www.datamesh.com\nFollow Us on WeChat: DataMesh\nService Email: service@datamesh.com",
